{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "f5e7958c52011d2d3f0bd135d78365087c255e0942bdb0b9bbc0e98ba54fa78e", "ja": "困惑の演技レッスン♡", "zh": "令人困惑的演技课程♡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b5f96840d39244ecab4abc0fe08aee275e6e72812fbf589767b7e8d828d7d96d", "ja": "セクシーカワイイ振り付けがうまく踊れない\n雪歩は、小悪魔の役作りをすることに。その\nお手本として、伊織と真がプロデューサーを\n誘惑してみせるが、どちらもピントがずれて\nいる。次に、美希が名乗り出て……。", "zh": "由于无法顺利跳出性感可爱的舞步，\n雪步开始摸索该如何演绎小恶魔的角色。\n为了替她做示范，伊织和真尝试诱惑制作人，\n然而两人都抓不到重点。\n接着，美希也上前挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "63e112ad5431bdf6a36e881c121c0ed795f1a05e43009d9f24849f3477f965a5", "ja": "（今日は新曲のレッスンだ。振り付けもなかなか、\nセクシーカワイイ感じだけど……）", "zh": "（今天要进行新歌的训练课程。\n虽然舞步相当性感可爱……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0e10ef4b898987d630afcd09f06ea4481840eb003fe883012a2bc84d03e45270", "ja": "1、2、3、4……。\n真ちゃん、ど、どうかな……？", "zh": "1、2、3、4……\n小真，我、我跳得怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "72772f7b93be6061d8dbfa2b8e5165e30a440e5c97715e7751deba53a84c27e5", "ja": "うん、振り付けどおりだよね。\n振り付けどおりなんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，舞步都跳对了。\n虽然都跳对了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "55edda4f6054963a973d36b77033088ed678ab667a03724f5f14d5a1d7700f36", "ja": "やっぱり……、全然ダメだよね。\n動きを追ってるだけで……はうう。", "zh": "果然……完全不行呢。\n这样只是在照本宣科而已……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "3a35fb58a5a7d2556ec23d0611b716f34cff5146c8b2c3da3dea7dec1e8ebffd", "ja": "雪歩、もうちょっと悪い子になっちゃえば？\n甘えちゃったり、誘惑しちゃったり♪", "zh": "雪步，当个再坏一点的女孩怎么样？\n像是撒撒娇、诱惑别人之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "18de32808956cea25f1176034e8d74b8c2ce4656ec8f58cb2b9f83f2420ad774", "ja": "誘惑！？　そんな大それたこと、\n私の人生とは縁が無かったから……。", "zh": "诱惑！？\n这么大胆的行为，一直都跟我无缘……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "edca4877d081d0ddfbcac4891cd0fae40ac69c82282e36dba63d03ba1e3e297c", "ja": "もしかしたら……これはダンスの前に、\nまず小悪魔としての役作りをした方がいいかな？", "zh": "或许……在练习舞蹈之前，\n先试着融入小恶魔的角色会比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "b7a617d25fb87c30c5ced146e0cbc58b23119bd1e9db4c2954594eaac0ae2cb1", "ja": "役作り……そっか！　小悪魔らしく、誰かを誘惑する\nお芝居ってことなら、いけるんじゃないかな！？", "zh": "融入角色……对耶！\n如果是扮演小恶魔去诱惑他人，说不定就有办法了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5ad0c1d7a11ea48e7231f000f3e82d8e927935a56bfb239b09b38c28f2108834", "ja": "お芝居なら……私にもできるかもですぅ。\n前に大魔王の役、やらせてもらえたし……。", "zh": "如果是演戏……我应该也办得到。\n毕竟我之前演过大魔王的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "72381a4f64edb53dbf237479895f35725390f94a5a905a93b9e61c1eb3965c0e", "ja": "ま、まあ大魔王までいくと、小悪魔とは\nちょっと差がありすぎるかもしれないけど。", "zh": "不、不过，要是用大魔王的感觉演，\n跟小恶魔形象的落差恐怕会有点太大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9bcc07365d141eea89c0d62fab78892259db32d0742318a45f9348c0ffd50bdc", "ja": "あう。そ、そうですよね。出世しすぎですよね……。\nすぐ調子に乗ってごめんなさい……。", "zh": "啊呜，说、说得也是，地位差太多了……\n我马上就得意忘形了，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "9318a81ccc2bcd1822faf5d70680dd606c9ce878a791ab0d363977519ab0ad90", "ja": "でも、演技するってところは同じよね。\nいいわ、それじゃ、私がお手本を見せてあげる♪", "zh": "不过，都需要演技这点是一样的吧。\n好，那就让我来示范给你看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0a4a09f16973c9b17aad8a04c8b56f9055fa04b0b5a962f72dd624a86737943d", "ja": "伊織ちゃん……！\nうう、ありがとう～～～！", "zh": "伊织……！\n呜呜，谢谢你～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "83ca5375b98cf89a46f3cfc54c392122c1817a2fb2f2fcc61d1af98138bc4ed1", "ja": "別にいいわよ、たいしたことじゃないし。\nじゃ、{$P$}、そこに立ってくれる？", "zh": "不用谢啦，又没有什么大不了的。\n那么{$P$}，你可以站到那里去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "262654f002eb0f6b416eb1d66dc24af7ba3a1691c964e2137738dd35eab81a5e", "ja": "えっ……。俺を誘惑する気なのか？", "zh": "咦……难道是要诱惑我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "0a6b56fc2b05d2e8a5d74b494cc4cdffd5edcfbb8830e4340944e895d1071f29", "ja": "別にアンタを誘惑したいわけじゃないわよ。\nイスとかカベ相手じゃ、よくわからないってだけ！", "zh": "可不是因为我想诱惑你喔。\n只是对着椅子或墙壁看不太出效果而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "45bae976b45c88aeac6d2f5844d92f488035b532726544cce75f9c6d20f7af66", "ja": "あはっ、そうだよね♪　{$P$}、\nあとでミキにも誘惑させてね☆", "zh": "啊哈，也是呢♪\n{$P$}，等一下也要让美希诱惑喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7f864fab9364188be09e0de1a9825780669391b10b201ee86fd13b290a242c64", "ja": "まあ、役に立つならいいけど……。\nじゃあ、伊織からどうぞ。", "zh": "能帮上忙的话，我是不介意啦……\n那么，伊织先来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "01bcc30412a58e58f8bc5eebda8bde5dd0dcb8389b57c0a03ca97daf0f8069a1", "ja": "コホン……！\nそれじゃあ行くわよ。", "zh": "咳咳……！\n那么，我要开始啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "01f1e05fd42ad71f0303f91e96bacdf3181f4ae6872df4188b26308977160f47", "ja": "あのねっ♪　伊織、オレンジジュースが飲みたいの♪\n今すぐ持ってきてくれたら、とってもうれしいです♪", "zh": "那个呀♪伊织好想喝柳橙汁♪\n要是能马上拿来给伊织，伊织会非常开心唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_1021", "source_sha256": "62a3e713f13c252452c90a0003af6e8df6b7db6b60f36a41f4d1260909358f2e", "ja": "わかりました", "zh": "我知道了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4f7e3e17c7f165ece51b55466c7c64f4f227038f56a00cfd7467f44916b3dbdf", "ja": "わかりました、買ってきます……。", "zh": "我知道了，我这就去买……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "93c8ac2d6265b6ec116b8584ad521d84d89fdb722c682b2fa36ebf57917fa569", "ja": "わあ、{$P$}が、\nまるで伊織ちゃんのシモベみたいに……！", "zh": "哇啊，{$P$}\n变得像是伊织的仆人一样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "b18b9a6be6af294d600a33f75bcd3cb87ac560eb9882d83e9604363f4a4c094d", "ja": "さすがはでこちゃんなの！", "zh": "真不愧是额头妹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2003_007ior", "source_sha256": "6b566a8458b7698099f60647d4fb4ecc6f737f72b5a765d738e7ef6ac475a543", "ja": "にひひっ♪　褒めるのはいいけど、\nでこちゃんって呼ぶの、やめなさいよね。", "zh": "咿嘻嘻♪要夸我是没关系，\n但不要叫我额头妹啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2004_006mak", "source_sha256": "8f4c6b2dc06236534591fa0c14effcb38bc836e0ade74847b24e133b54ed7198", "ja": "でも、気のせいかな？\nなんていうか、いつも通りじゃない？", "zh": "不过，或许是在下的错觉，\n该怎么说……这不就和平常一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2005_p", "source_sha256": "ad7534688f4f08fc0dfe1e09716c957a70c5aae62e5208001c758f08c47d7d8c", "ja": "うん、言うこと聞いておいてなんだけど……\nセクシーカワイイっていうのとは、ちょっと違うかな？", "zh": "嗯，虽然我答应了你的要求啦……\n但这好像和性感可爱不太一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2006_007ior", "source_sha256": "4a9007b7842585850cfbfaf2357fa4dbb8073973b0450c0cfde55928aafd625e", "ja": "うるさいわね～、細かいことはいいじゃないっ。\nそんなこと言うなら、真もやってみなさいよ！", "zh": "真啰嗦耶～别计较这种小事啦。\n要是这么觉得，那真你来试试看啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2007_006mak", "source_sha256": "4af65ae6cafdb38101ab8ab86f235043eedf208815a65b305cbab13680740d2c", "ja": "えっ、ボクが小悪魔役を？　ボクが小悪魔……。\nでも、そうだよね。今こそボクが小悪魔になる時……！", "zh": "咦，要在下扮演小恶魔吗？在下扮演小恶魔……\n不过也好，现在正是在下化身为小恶魔的时刻……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a1c8819fb8b5155851f639321b35debb981a9b38289d2520150dc82d87d10afb", "ja": "ま、真ちゃん、ムリしなくても……。", "zh": "小、小真，不必勉强喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2009_006mak", "source_sha256": "afa6795940b1d6ea13b729725a0cc8dce0e8e2487eae0646b53ea0d107307d37", "ja": "いいんだ雪歩。ボクの考えた最高の小悪魔、いくよ！\n{$P$}、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "没关系，雪步，在下会演绎出自己心目中最棒的小恶魔！\n{$P$}，麻烦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2010_p", "source_sha256": "3cf9ae380451a0a0d364d21223af4cf31bb4cd63f5021e861d767d7d012e0a66", "ja": "また相手役なのか……。わかった！", "zh": "对象又是我啊……我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2011_006mak", "source_sha256": "cb92988cb57ac9ccbbc7e4084fbb97e8bd1440d62a374f3af2f5c1517103d87d", "ja": "あ、田胡之浦君♪　ううん、茶々美も今来たところっ。\nぜんぜん待ってなんか……くしゅん！　あ、ゴメンネ♪", "zh": "啊，田胡之浦♪别担心，茶茶美也才刚到，\n没有等太久……哈啾！啊，对不起唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_2013", "source_sha256": "55c29547b1cf98a68fbd97c9c2f77e2cda5b0f79d5726687abddc8c37fbc9c12", "ja": "田胡之浦君？", "zh": "田胡之浦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3000_p", "source_sha256": "49a39eda9ed358dc510c407e36efcca97ac8375659dd1ca7549a22f6fe324d6b", "ja": "田胡之浦君……は、いったい何者なんだ？", "zh": "田胡之浦……是谁啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3001_006mak", "source_sha256": "99e3ebb39ca938250f0ea5db1a3f936f9d18df7eeb60930748035f6bc98f3a95", "ja": "もちろん、サッカー部の爽やか系イケメンです！　\n茶々美は第二部あたりから出てくるイメージですね！", "zh": "当然是足球社的清爽系帅哥啊！\n茶茶美是会在第二部左右出场的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3002_003mik", "source_sha256": "882e6e7d3e4307680c16f0666b10ac5c2c188ce8ba97124ba2752455e7969235", "ja": "あはっ。茶々美はわざとくしゃみしたってカンジ？", "zh": "啊哈，茶茶美是故意打喷嚏的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d9d363382909d1a044d4070e6f24de5f3a207d6dffe8dd6b1c2abe18e5483eb2", "ja": "田胡之浦君にアピールしたんだ……？\nうう、ドキドキするかも……！", "zh": "是为了吸引田胡之浦的注意……？\n呜呜，好像有点心跳加速了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3004_006mak", "source_sha256": "9b5c44335ce52760a49dd2b681ed90f288431e9872504e2a91ab58ff2b08f5ab", "ja": "そう、そうなんだよ！　他にも田胡之浦君には、\n小さい頃に仲の良かったいとこがいたりして～♪", "zh": "没错，就是那样！\n然后田胡之浦还有一个从小感情就很好的表妹～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3005_007ior", "source_sha256": "2da16a27f90222b17ee8de4cffb3f9ab68352b8bee5b5a22b91ccee9ac06e032", "ja": "あきれた、ただの少女漫画じゃない。\nセクシーでもなんでもないわ。", "zh": "真是的，那不就只是少女漫画的剧情吗？\n一点也称不上性感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3006_006mak", "source_sha256": "66c49a751cd008bb1ca512e1a5741d35a8d4065e883bda573a17d2582b3f4586", "ja": "ええっ！？　でも、茶々美はスタイル抜群って設定で、\nまさに小悪魔役って感じなんだよ？", "zh": "咦！？但茶茶美在角色设定上有着傲人的身材，\n完全就是个小恶魔啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3007_p", "source_sha256": "af8d4437bed036a3e5293454e7eb76e17c5653835606fde0350bc4c4ca4c83bc", "ja": "立ち回りは小悪魔的なんだろうけど……。\nでもユニットテーマとは、ちょっと違うかな？", "zh": "她的行为或许算得上是小恶魔……\n但感觉和团体主题不太相符？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3008_006mak", "source_sha256": "ada3cae2120037c7b4a48929676328a2e6e55bcd4def12da42168bcc6c1ed1de", "ja": "うっ。そ、そっか。言われてみればそんな気も……。\nくぅ、盲点でした……！", "zh": "唔，这、这样啊，听你这么一说好像也是……\n可恶，真是一大盲点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_02_3009_003mik", "source_sha256": "6750002c61d8e1c52cf1f260f815dc297a279cd1d670cb49ac5f3142374b37cf", "ja": "じゃあ、次はミキの番ね。{$P$}、\nミキのこと……見て？", "zh": "那接下来轮到美希了。\n{$P$}……要看着美希喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
